        "key": "trampoline--review-expand-a4b96a89-29b9-438c-b3ee-a66cb85f7591",
        "text": "Remember how we built the strong *structure* of our owl webpage? HTML helped us organize all our fascinating facts into clear sections like the header, main content, and footer.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/710f1fac0d1dbb28dd482ab3dd6e9bf8-trampoline--review-expand-panel-1-8236ffb2-6a2a-4b1d-9fb7-3a6a9ede2935.png",
        "layout": "text-top-center"
      },
      {
        "key": "trampoline--review-expand-0d9232d5-8675-4cd1-9853-bc9f248b7a61",
        "text": "Then, with CSS, we transformed that structure into a beautiful digital poster! We added colors, chose stylish fonts, and arranged everything to look fantastic and easy to read.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/88bf5ab3c38a015b607fdba4203e4a51-trampoline--review-expand-panel-2-c87b2a87-4925-4c36-b4ec-34fd0d584486.png",
        "layout": "text-bottom-center"
      },
      {
        "key": "trampoline--review-expand-5987c71b-2f1d-4a23-b26b-8272cd9e953c",
        "text": "Now you have a complete, beautiful owl webpage! How could you expand it? What other amazing facts or pictures would you add, or how might you make it even more interactive and engaging?",
